    "body": "Both FF7 products now use the shared mod selector. First open creates a private baseline template and a default editable mod from that product's installed English KERNEL.BIN; New Mod clones that template, Find a Mod validates the exact product-relative kernel path, and switching restarts the editor on the selected project. New, find, switch, both product overlays, both plugin smokes, and the hidden shared-host selector render passed. Installed game files remain unchanged.",
